        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLBIA, Crystal Biarritz Knob with Soleil Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Biarritz Crystal Knob with Soleil Rose is a beautiful pairing of designs. The Biarritz Knob's unique oval shape and intricate design add splendor to the boldness of the  Soleil Rosette. The Soleil Rosette with Biarritz Crystal Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. While the Crystal Biarritz Knob is clear, the Soleil Rose is available in several finish options. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLBIA Soleil Rosette with Biarritz Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Biarritz Knob with Soleil Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Material: 24% Lead Crystal</li>\r\n<li>Rose Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Height: 2.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Width: 1.80\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLBIA-specifications.pdf?v=1704262393\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLBIA Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
