                "description": "The Biarritz Crystal Knob with Soleil Rose is a beautiful pairing of designs. The Biarritz Knob's unique oval shape and intricate design add splendor to the boldness of the  Soleil Rosette. The Soleil Rosette with Biarritz Crystal Knob is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit most pre-drilled doors. While the Crystal Biarritz Knob is clear, the Soleil Rose is available in several finish options. \r\n",
